The '''Galdr Table''' is a [[Player base|base]] structure used for crafting and repairing [[Mistlands]] and [[Ashlands]] gear relating to [[magic]]. It requires a roof and 70% [[cover]] to be usable. Repairing items does not cost any resources.

== Upgrades ==
Upgrading a Galdr Table enables additional crafting recipes and higher upgrade levels for items. A Galdr Table can be upgraded up to level {{Max crafting level|Galdr table}} by building the following structures near it:
